{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\nYou are an expert Question Answering system. Output structured reasoning steps before the final answer.\n\nContext:\nThe bakers at the Beverly Hills Bakery baked 200 loaves of bread on Monday morning.\nThey sold 93 loaves in the morning and 39 loaves in the afternoon. A grocery store returned 6 unsold loaves.\n\nQuery:\nHow many loaves of bread did they have left?\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"reasoning":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","description":"Correctly extract items of type: ReasoningStep","properties":{"step":{"type":"integer"},"subquestion":{"type":"string"},"procedure":{"type":"string"},"result":{"type":"string"}},"required":["step","subquestion","procedure","result"],"additionalProperties":false}},"correct_answer":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["reasoning","correct_answer"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}